<title>JAPAN: Kyogoku Unyu Shoji - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kyogoku Unyu Shoji - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  5.57		vs	    5.84</p>
<p> Operating	   44    million    vs	   32    million</p>
<p> Current	     52    million    vs	   30    million</p>
<p> Net		   28    million    vs	    2    million</p>
<p> EPS		    8.87 yen	  vs	    0.65 yen</p>
<p> Shares		3 million	  vs	   3 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Kyogoku Unyu Shoji Co Ltd is a transport company handling the products of Mitsubishi Oil.</p>
</text>
